# Input
```vue
<template>
	<!-- should generate diagnostics -->
	<div>
		<div role="button"></div>
		<div role="tab"></div>
		<!-- static Vue role bindings with interactive roles but missing tabindex should also be flagged -->
		<div :role="'button'"></div>
		<div v-bind:role="'tab'"></div>
	</div>
</template>

```

